{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Gu1eLqE1BBmCaefAWOby3g","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:55.568368+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Gu1eLqE1BBmCaefAWOby3g","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>1</span></strong></span></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>2025年夏令营活动简介</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><p><span><span>医学科学院、天健先进生物医学实验室（郑州大学）是整合郑州大学医学学科优势资源设立的高水平研究机构，负责实施医学高水平科研和高层次人才培养，汇聚高水平研究团队，凝练学科研究方向，加强医学科研成果推广和基础研究向临床医疗转化，建设高水平医学科研平台和实验基地。突出“以临床需求引领基础研究，以基础研究提升临床诊疗水平”，带动提升郑州大学医学科研整体水平。</span></span></p><p><span><span>学院现有院士3人，国家杰青4人，科技部火炬计划1人，国家级青年人才8人和省部级人才7人，形成了拥有以院士为引领，国家级杰出人才为带头人，学科特聘教授为骨干的高素质的科研团队；学院各种科研仪器设备齐全，建有完善的共享平台。2016年4月学院获批全国首批地方高校试点建设的国际化示范学院。2017年9月与学校相关院系和附属医院共建“临床医学”入选一流学科建设序列。2019年“省部共建食管癌防治国家重点实验室”获科技部和河南省政府批准建设。天健先进生物医学实验室为2023年河南省人民政府批准建设的第四批省实验室。2024年“省部共建食管癌防治国家重点实验室”获批重组为“代谢紊乱与食管癌防治全国重点实验室”。</span></span></p><p><span><span>学院网站：https://www5.zzu.edu.cn/yxkxy/index.htm</span></span></p><p><span><span>我院将于2025年暑期举办优秀大学生夏令营活动。诚挚邀请热爱生物医学的你，加入2025年优秀大学生夏令营！让我们在这个夏天，以科学之名相遇，携手探索生命之奥秘！</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aVfdduZ8Gic31yCMZI5mNXeQ1K5Q1TyEZOJHUq4lTV2sMxMicNniaX2ic97x2vZticTZ0dnAQMjjm8b09q60WW4tRwQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aVfdduZ8Gic31yCMZI5mNXeQ1K5Q1TyEZxtZpRicTLPIyHS5cDf7NVFwvdzgicSa65mHXsV54FR3AichmbVsyp1Tiaw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>2</span></strong></span></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>活动时间</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><p><span><span>2025年7月31日-2025年8月2日</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aVfdduZ8Gic31yCMZI5mNXeQ1K5Q1TyEZxtZpRicTLPIyHS5cDf7NVFwvdzgicSa65mHXsV54FR3AichmbVsyp1Tiaw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aVfdduZ8Gic31yCMZI5mNXeQ1K5Q1TyEZ2mc6RIq1qEWmPMjksbkT2MFia2ZiaPAIajEOmpkFwMz905Mfn1fBHeRg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>3</span></strong></span></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>报名条件</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><p><span><span>1.具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.医学、生物、药学等相关专业2026年应届本科毕业生。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.在校期间学习成绩优异，获得推免资格或预期可获得推免资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.英语水平良好。</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.遵守学术道德规范，具有较强的学术创新或实践应用能力。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aVfdduZ8Gic31yCMZI5mNXeQ1K5Q1TyEZOJHUq4lTV2sMxMicNniaX2ic97x2vZticTZ0dnAQMjjm8b09q60WW4tRwQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aVfdduZ8Gic31yCMZI5mNXeQ1K5Q1TyEZxtZpRicTLPIyHS5cDf7NVFwvdzgicSa65mHXsV54FR3AichmbVsyp1Tiaw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>04</span></strong></span></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>报名时间</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><p><span><span>2025年7月10日08:00-2025年7月21日17:00</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aVfdduZ8Gic31yCMZI5mNXeQ1K5Q1TyEZOJHUq4lTV2sMxMicNniaX2ic97x2vZticTZ0dnAQMjjm8b09q60WW4tRwQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aVfdduZ8Gic31yCMZI5mNXeQ1K5Q1TyEZxtZpRicTLPIyHS5cDf7NVFwvdzgicSa65mHXsV54FR3AichmbVsyp1Tiaw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>05</span></strong></span></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>报名材料</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>个人身份证（正反面）；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2.本科阶段成绩单（须加盖教务处或院系公章），JPG或PDF格式。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.外语水平证明，如CET-4、CET-6、雅思、托福、专业外语成绩等。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.其他证明材料：获奖证书和学术科研成果，如发表论文、出版物或其他原创性工作等。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>将以上材料按顺序整合成一个PDF文件，命名为“本科学校名称+姓名+手机号”，请于</span></span><strong><span><span>2025年7月21日17:00</span></span></strong><span><span>前发送至邮箱amsyanjiusheng@zzu.edu.cn，学院研究生办公室负责组织资格预审。</span></span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aVfdduZ8Gic31yCMZI5mNXeQ1K5Q1TyEZOJHUq4lTV2sMxMicNniaX2ic97x2vZticTZ0dnAQMjjm8b09q60WW4tRwQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aVfdduZ8Gic31yCMZI5mNXeQ1K5Q1TyEZxtZpRicTLPIyHS5cDf7NVFwvdzgicSa65mHXsV54FR3AichmbVsyp1Tiaw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>06</span></strong></span></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>录取公示</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>学院将组织专家小组，对每位预审通过者的申请材料进行初审评分，根据初审成绩择优确定夏令营入围营员名单，名单拟于7月23日在学院官网发布。</span></span></p><p><span><span>入围营员请以“本科学校名称+姓名+手机号”身份加入2025医学科学院夏令营QQ群：934171047，未实名备注加群者不予通过。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aVfdduZ8Gic31yCMZI5mNXeQ1K5Q1TyEZOJHUq4lTV2sMxMicNniaX2ic97x2vZticTZ0dnAQMjjm8b09q60WW4tRwQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aVfdduZ8Gic31yCMZI5mNXeQ1K5Q1TyEZxtZpRicTLPIyHS5cDf7NVFwvdzgicSa65mHXsV54FR3AichmbVsyp1Tiaw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>07</span></strong></span></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>夏令营日程安排</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>第一天（7月31日）：下午(13:00-18:00) 学员报到登记，安排住宿。</span></span></p><p><span><span>第二天（8月1日）：导师交流，参观实验室。</span></span></p><p><span><span>第三天（8月2日）：优秀营员遴选，闭营离校。</span></span></p><p><span><span>务必全程参加夏令营活动，不得擅自离营，违者将可能被终止后续夏令营活动。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aVfdduZ8Gic31yCMZI5mNXeQ1K5Q1TyEZOJHUq4lTV2sMxMicNniaX2ic97x2vZticTZ0dnAQMjjm8b09q60WW4tRwQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aVfdduZ8Gic31yCMZI5mNXeQ1K5Q1TyEZxtZpRicTLPIyHS5cDf7NVFwvdzgicSa65mHXsV54FR3AichmbVsyp1Tiaw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>08</span></strong></span></section></section><section><section><section><strong><span>相关说明</span></strong></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1.入营同学在入营报到时需提供报名材料复印件，申请人应保证提交材料的真实性和准确性。凡提供虚假信息的，一经查实即取消申请资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.导师的研究方向、学术成果、联系方式等可登陆学院网站师资队伍查看。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.咨询方式：0371-66658832，联系人：楼老师</span></span></p><p><span><span>邮箱：</span></span><span><span>amsyanjiusheng@zzu.edu.cn</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aVfdduZ8Gic31yCMZI5mNXeQ1K5Q1TyEZOJHUq4lTV2sMxMicNniaX2ic97x2vZticTZ0dnAQMjjm8b09q60WW4tRwQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aVfdduZ8Gic31yCMZI5mNXeQ1K5Q1TyEZxtZpRicTLPIyHS5cDf7NVFwvdzgicSa65mHXsV54F